WEBVTT

00:18.101 --> 00:19.144
Come on, come on, come on!

00:19.227 --> 00:20.186
Hey, hey, hey!

00:20.770 --> 00:22.856
Copy that, unit 12.

00:22.939 --> 00:24.607
They're in the van!

00:25.567 --> 00:27.485
Get these people out of here.

00:31.072 --> 00:33.158
-Clear!
-Oh my God! He's got a gun.

00:33.241 --> 00:35.410
Get down, get down! Get down!

00:38.246 --> 00:41.624
Come on. Down. Down, down, down, down!

01:02.020 --> 01:03.772
Smoke!

01:20.455 --> 01:21.289
Go!

01:37.388 --> 01:39.099
Behind you! Bag!

01:39.724 --> 01:42.102
Hurry up!

01:42.977 --> 01:44.395
Coming up on your six!

01:44.479 --> 01:45.980
On your six!

01:46.064 --> 01:47.857
Overwhelm. Go!

01:48.483 --> 01:49.984
Go.

01:51.027 --> 01:52.028
Move!

02:00.328 --> 02:01.913
Motherfucker!

02:04.207 --> 02:06.042
That's a big fucking gun!

02:06.126 --> 02:07.544
-Fall back.
-What the fuck?!

02:16.177 --> 02:17.595
Jesus fucking Christ!

02:28.731 --> 02:32.277
Fuck you!

02:34.112 --> 02:35.363
Officer down!

02:38.241 --> 02:39.993
Not today.

03:01.431 --> 03:03.308
Brinkley, go, go!

03:06.352 --> 03:07.478
Fall back!

03:08.730 --> 03:10.481
-'Trane, come on!
-Come on!

03:10.565 --> 03:11.566
Let's go!

03:12.192 --> 03:13.067
Shit!

03:18.823 --> 03:20.867
I got you. I'll clear a path.

03:36.382 --> 03:38.426
Fuck you, bitch!

03:47.268 --> 03:48.394
Watch out!

03:52.732 --> 03:53.942
Nigga, what the--

03:54.025 --> 03:55.109
You can bench me later!

03:55.193 --> 03:57.570
For now, I'm covering you.
Let’s get this motherfucker!

03:58.071 --> 04:00.281
Wait! Riley! Riley!

04:00.365 --> 04:01.574
Riley!

04:04.244 --> 04:06.162
-Shit.
-Fuck!

04:07.121 --> 04:08.665
Okay, listen.

04:08.748 --> 04:10.833
When I give you the order, you cover me.

04:10.917 --> 04:12.502
I'm going up one car over.

04:13.044 --> 04:13.962
Okay?

04:14.754 --> 04:16.714
-Alright, give it to him, give it to him.
-Move!

04:16.798 --> 04:18.508
Go, go, go, go, go!

04:18.591 --> 04:21.177
Brinkley!

04:37.402 --> 04:38.695
Brinkley!

04:38.778 --> 04:39.654
Fall back!

04:44.951 --> 04:47.245
Hey, hey, hey! What's wrong?

04:47.328 --> 04:48.705
Officer down!

04:48.788 --> 04:50.581
Brinkley, hey, Brinkley!

04:50.665 --> 04:53.376
Look at me, Brinkley!
You're gonna fight. You're gonna live.

04:54.210 --> 04:55.461
You fight, and you'll live.

05:06.389 --> 05:07.974
Shit!

05:09.058 --> 05:10.393
Come on, nigga!

05:25.867 --> 05:28.077
Stro.

05:53.061 --> 05:54.103
Go.

05:56.105 --> 05:57.815
Fuck!

06:06.532 --> 06:08.076
This is the police!

06:08.159 --> 06:10.745
Drop your weapons
and surrender immediately!

06:10.828 --> 06:12.246
You are surrounded!

06:44.904 --> 06:46.197
Where the fuck is he?

07:29.323 --> 07:31.033
Freeze, motherfucker.

07:35.621 --> 07:36.831
Drop it.

07:54.140 --> 07:55.391
Backup transpo.

07:55.475 --> 07:59.061
Gold Honda Accord,
corner of Thayer and Verona.

07:59.145 --> 08:01.689
Charlie says, "You're welcome."

08:06.277 --> 08:07.862
Looks like I got the wrong guy.

08:07.945 --> 08:10.072
Sorry to have disturbed you, sir.

08:20.958 --> 08:23.753
I tossed a duffel bag
in the alley dumpster around the corner.

08:23.836 --> 08:25.171
Find it and burn it.

08:26.297 --> 08:27.757
You have a nice day.

08:39.685 --> 08:41.229
You guys got everything?

08:44.023 --> 08:45.691
I need to talk to him.

08:50.696 --> 08:51.822
Two minutes.

08:52.448 --> 08:53.449
Yep.

09:05.336 --> 09:06.963
I thought your crew was smarter than this.

09:07.046 --> 09:10.758
You're shooting cops in broad daylight.
That's the death penalty, nigga.

09:11.384 --> 09:13.636
And even if your boy Choi, if he lives,

09:14.554 --> 09:16.347
both y'all about to get gassed up,

09:16.931 --> 09:19.934
and that's if y'all even make it to trial,

09:20.017 --> 09:22.728
'cause you know that jail
is a dangerous motherfucking place

09:22.812 --> 09:24.522
for some cop killers.
You know that, right?

09:26.274 --> 09:27.316
Mm-mm.

09:27.400 --> 09:30.152
I'll tell you what.
Maybe I can figure out a way

09:30.236 --> 09:33.239
to get you into ISO
long enough to see trial.

09:33.322 --> 09:35.116
I can do you that solid.

09:36.576 --> 09:37.702
If you tell me…

09:40.162 --> 09:41.122
where Nightmare is.

09:45.626 --> 09:46.961
Lawyer, motherfucker.

09:48.629 --> 09:50.214
Yeah, I was hoping you'd say that.

09:56.971 --> 10:00.224
Tell me where Nightmare is.

10:01.726 --> 10:04.437
Tell me where Nightmare is, Stro.

10:07.273 --> 10:08.107
Come on!

10:10.234 --> 10:13.446
Tell me where Nightmare is!
I know this shit hurts, Stro!

10:13.529 --> 10:18.200
-Come on, nigga, tell me where he is!
-Whoa! Back up! You can't be doing that!

10:18.284 --> 10:19.744
-Fine!
-Let's go!

10:23.331 --> 10:26.250
You take real good care of this man.
We got plans for him.

10:26.334 --> 10:27.960
Fuck you, nigga!

10:48.022 --> 10:49.940
Where the fuck you at, man?

11:12.797 --> 11:15.091
It's a goddamn bloodbath.

11:22.056 --> 11:24.016
I got good police on the way
to the morgue.

11:24.100 --> 11:25.726
Got even more headed to the ER,

11:25.810 --> 11:28.979
where I got a bunch of innocent civilians
hit in the crossfire,

11:29.063 --> 11:31.148
and I got the chief
crawling so far up my ass,

11:31.232 --> 11:33.609
I chipped a tooth on his cuff links.

11:33.693 --> 11:36.904
What I don't got is a fucking clue
of what happened here,

11:36.987 --> 11:41.325
but I know you do because you told Yvette
to bring backup to this exact location.

11:41.409 --> 11:45.705
And Vig, who is dead,
called me to tell me the same damn thing!

11:45.788 --> 11:46.622
So talk!

11:49.083 --> 11:50.751
I got a tip about Coltrane Wilder.

11:50.835 --> 11:53.254
-We showed up. They started shooting.
-You saw Wilder?

11:53.921 --> 11:55.798
-He was wearing a mask.
-Then you didn't see him!

11:55.881 --> 11:58.634
I'm sick of this shit, Isaiah!
Who gave you the tip?

12:03.639 --> 12:04.724
I can't say.

12:07.059 --> 12:08.269
You can't?

12:09.979 --> 12:11.689
Ain't this a bitch?

12:12.857 --> 12:15.317
After all the shit I done
protecting your ass,

12:15.401 --> 12:16.610
you're gonna do me like this.

12:19.905 --> 12:21.866
You see all that blood on the ground?

12:21.949 --> 12:24.201
All that blood is about to turn to shit.

12:24.285 --> 12:28.080
Bionic type shit
because it don't roll downhill.

12:28.164 --> 12:32.501
It runs uphill like a goddamn Kenyan,
and I'm gonna be up to my neck in it

12:32.585 --> 12:34.253
if I don't have answers!

12:38.507 --> 12:40.176
I'm sorry, Captain.

12:40.259 --> 12:41.177
I--

12:45.973 --> 12:47.516
You think he's gonna listen to me?

12:48.893 --> 12:50.269
All right.

12:50.352 --> 12:52.938
I'm gonna make this
real simple for you, Isaiah.

12:53.898 --> 12:55.524
Either give me answers…

12:56.901 --> 12:58.319
or give me your gun and badge.

13:28.057 --> 13:28.891
All right.

13:29.600 --> 13:33.687
If that's how you're gonna play it,
get your ass back to RHD for questioning.

13:33.771 --> 13:35.815
IA's gonna wanna speak with you.

13:39.318 --> 13:41.320
You're flying solo now, Isaiah.

13:42.947 --> 13:44.532
Bon fucking voyage.

13:55.835 --> 13:59.171
A citywide manhunt
for two cop killers is underway…

13:59.255 --> 14:02.216
I'm telling you,
my Galil was spitting heat!

14:03.259 --> 14:04.969
Dropping bombs, nigga!

14:05.052 --> 14:08.973
Sound like we brought World War 3
to the motherfucking streets of LA!

14:09.056 --> 14:10.599
Yo, this shit all in my feed.

14:10.683 --> 14:13.727
-Hey, yo. You like OJ and shit.
-Nigga, OJ only got two bodies.

14:13.811 --> 14:16.105
I killed more police
than cholesterol, nigga.

14:17.523 --> 14:20.901
Bam, bam, bam, bam, bam!

14:25.072 --> 14:27.283
Hey, yo, what the fuck's funny, nigga?

14:27.783 --> 14:29.994
-Show some respect.
-Respect?

14:31.745 --> 14:35.708
You think this Morgan Freeman-looking
motherfucker killed the police?

14:37.793 --> 14:40.880
This janitor-looking nigga
look like he can't take out the trash.

14:44.466 --> 14:45.968
You done fucked up now.

14:50.723 --> 14:53.559
What, I'm supposed to be scared
of this puff of smoke in the onesie?

14:57.187 --> 14:59.273
Think I'm too old to fuck you up?

15:00.399 --> 15:03.485
I think you're too old
to fuck, period, OG.

15:03.569 --> 15:05.779
You probably can't--

15:07.698 --> 15:09.408
-Whoa!
-Jesus.

15:22.755 --> 15:25.674
Looks like I got me some new threads.

15:28.844 --> 15:32.848
Thought I said I needed a clean car
and someone to check on my house too!

15:36.018 --> 15:37.102
Here.

15:38.437 --> 15:41.899
Go get 50 Melo burgers
and every kind of shake they got.

15:43.651 --> 15:45.694
Fucking niggas up make me hungry!

16:36.620 --> 16:37.621
Isaiah?

16:39.540 --> 16:40.374
Hey, uh…

16:41.750 --> 16:45.379
Hey, you're-- you're home early.

16:45.462 --> 16:46.338
Yeah, um…

16:48.382 --> 16:50.843
I don't know. I don't know
how to tell you this, but, um…

16:51.802 --> 16:55.973
My father, he was involved in a massive
shootout with the police this morning.

16:57.307 --> 16:58.475
Amos? What…

16:59.393 --> 17:01.687
Uh, just… look at this shit.

17:01.770 --> 17:04.982
There are multiple, multiple casualties…

17:05.607 --> 17:08.152
Oh, sh…

17:08.235 --> 17:10.070
He shot Brinkley right in front of me.

17:10.696 --> 17:12.239
Oh my God. Is… is Brinkley…?

17:12.322 --> 17:15.826
No, he's in the hospital, but I can't go
because I gotta get Amos first.

17:15.909 --> 17:17.619
If they get to him,
you know what they'll do.

17:17.703 --> 17:19.371
Shoot first, ask questions never.

17:19.455 --> 17:21.999
Okay, but is that really
why you wanna find him?

17:22.708 --> 17:24.043
To save him?

17:24.877 --> 17:27.254
I mean, I need to bring him in
for a whole lot of things.

17:27.337 --> 17:30.174
Top of that list is
because he is the only one

17:30.257 --> 17:33.260
who can identify the guy
who brought him into this shit.

17:33.343 --> 17:36.263
It's the same guy that
I've been hunting this whole time.

17:36.346 --> 17:37.598
The same guy who killed Manny.

17:38.265 --> 17:39.308
Coltrane Wilder?

17:40.976 --> 17:43.562
You think I wouldn't figure that out
after you raided Ebony's house?

17:43.645 --> 17:48.192
Yes, yes. Coltrane Wilder,
who knew I was close to getting his ass,

17:48.275 --> 17:51.487
so he brought my father
into his latest crime to fuck me up.

17:51.570 --> 17:53.822
No, fuck that. I'm…
I'm taking Noah to my father's house,

17:53.906 --> 17:56.450
where things will be safe
until this all settles down.

17:56.533 --> 17:58.869
Okay, yeah, that's good.
It's not safe until I find him.

17:59.453 --> 18:00.829
I'm gonna call you later.

18:01.872 --> 18:03.415
-I'm gonna figure it out.
-Sh…

18:03.499 --> 18:06.919
Sure you'll figure it out.
I can't believe this. I can't believe…

18:13.217 --> 18:14.718
Goddamn it, Coltrane.

18:14.802 --> 18:16.595
It's all over the news.

18:18.222 --> 18:20.516
-Things went a little left.
-A little?

18:21.183 --> 18:23.977
I keep asking you,
and you keep giving me the same line.

18:24.061 --> 18:26.855
"Everything's under control."
But that's not what I saw on the TV.

18:26.939 --> 18:29.608
-Ebony…
-No, Coltrane, I'm done asking.

18:29.691 --> 18:32.486
Now I'm telling you. It's time to go.

18:32.569 --> 18:36.573
I'm getting on a jet with Charlie tonight
at midnight. You need to be on it too.

18:40.536 --> 18:41.787
I'll be there.

18:42.704 --> 18:44.832
There's one thing I need.
Put your sister on the phone.

18:44.915 --> 18:45.958
Coltrane.

18:46.041 --> 18:48.544
Please, Ebony.
I'll be on the plane. I just…

18:50.337 --> 18:51.839
I need to talk to Charlie first.

18:56.301 --> 18:57.761
He wants to talk to you.

18:58.512 --> 18:59.638
Hey.

19:00.848 --> 19:02.141
We got this.

19:11.400 --> 19:13.902
-What the fuck happened?
-It doesn't matter.

19:13.986 --> 19:15.529
What matters is what happens now.

19:15.612 --> 19:18.448
And right now I need to find the wheelman
and put him down.

19:18.532 --> 19:20.534
I can't have a loose end
walking around the streets.

19:20.617 --> 19:22.035
He's a cop killer.

19:22.119 --> 19:25.038
Chances are they'll shoot him on sight.
Let the LAPD do your job for you.

19:25.122 --> 19:27.541
Charlie, I can't stake
my future on chance.

19:27.624 --> 19:29.376
I gotta know for sure
he's never gonna talk.

19:29.960 --> 19:32.588
Give me a name. I'll put my people on it.

19:34.715 --> 19:36.925
Help me help you, Coltrane.

19:38.802 --> 19:40.053
Amos Stiles.

19:40.846 --> 19:42.639
The cop's daddy?

19:42.723 --> 19:44.808
You took what was already
a very high-risk job,

19:44.892 --> 19:47.144
taking down a man
that could jeopardize both our futures,

19:47.227 --> 19:49.396
and you decided
this was a good two-for-one opportunity?

19:49.479 --> 19:50.564
It was worth the risk.

19:50.647 --> 19:52.316
Nightmare's prints are
on the murder weapon.

19:52.399 --> 19:54.735
When they find that,
Stiles' case against us crumbles,

19:54.818 --> 19:56.945
along with his credibility
in the department.

19:58.322 --> 20:01.283
He'll be completely compromised.
And we won't have to worry about Stiles.

20:01.366 --> 20:02.367
It's a good fucking plan.

20:02.451 --> 20:05.454
What part of the plan
was getting in a shootout in Century City?

20:05.537 --> 20:08.373
Unforeseen circumstances.
Listen, we reacted as best as we could.

20:08.457 --> 20:10.709
And now I got word that Stro and Choi
are in the hospital.

20:10.792 --> 20:12.878
And the guy you wanna take the fall
is in the wind.

20:12.961 --> 20:15.422
You don't think I fucking know that?

20:16.215 --> 20:18.383
I saw them both go down. I tried to…

20:19.134 --> 20:20.761
I couldn't get to them.

20:21.595 --> 20:24.181
That's why I need to finish this shit.
I need to carry out the plan.

20:24.264 --> 20:29.186
No, the only plan you should have is being
at that OB-GYN appointment with Ebony

20:29.269 --> 20:33.273
to solidify your alibi, and then
be on that jet tonight, all right?

20:33.357 --> 20:34.691
I'll handle Nightmare.

20:34.775 --> 20:38.862
-I'm already looking for Nightmare.
-Look, you have done enough, all right?

20:38.946 --> 20:42.366
You need to act like citizen Wilder
while I handle this shit.

20:42.950 --> 20:44.993
Focus on being there for my sister.

20:45.994 --> 20:47.246
We good?

20:48.830 --> 20:49.915
We good.

20:53.001 --> 20:56.421
Stiles, it's Cerullo.
Brinkley is still alive, but critical.

20:56.505 --> 20:58.799
Doctors are operating on him now.

20:58.882 --> 21:01.093
And I'll keep you posted
if I hear anything else.

21:06.556 --> 21:07.891
Where's Nightmare?

21:07.975 --> 21:11.478
Oh, shit. This nigga done lost his daddy.

21:11.561 --> 21:14.815
Yeah, I'm not the one,
not today, not ever.

21:14.898 --> 21:16.942
-Now move aside, man.
-Whoa!

21:18.318 --> 21:21.989
Now I said your daddy ain't here,
so unless you got a warrant,

21:22.072 --> 21:23.949
you're gonna have to take my word
on that shit.

21:24.032 --> 21:27.869
I don't need no warrant.
Hear that loud rap music?

21:27.953 --> 21:30.664
You know that's
the probable cause theme song, right?

21:32.332 --> 21:33.500
Whoa.

21:35.085 --> 21:39.381
You thought I'd pull a piece on you,
serve up some probable cause? Nah.

21:39.464 --> 21:42.259
We some Blacktivist niggas around here,

21:42.342 --> 21:45.095
documenting police brutality
for these here streets.

21:45.721 --> 21:46.930
Got the world watching.

21:47.014 --> 21:51.059
Now, Mr. Police Officer,
what you think about that?

21:57.274 --> 21:59.151
We live, baby.

22:08.201 --> 22:09.328
Hey, Mama.

22:10.120 --> 22:11.413
Hi.

22:11.496 --> 22:12.456
How's our baby?

22:13.206 --> 22:14.708
I didn't think you were gonna make it.

22:16.126 --> 22:18.128
I wouldn't miss it for the world.

22:18.211 --> 22:19.838
Glad you could be here.

22:19.921 --> 22:23.133
We were just about
to begin the ultrasound. Ready?

22:23.216 --> 22:24.217
Yeah.

23:16.019 --> 23:20.148
Take them heels off
Before you jump up in this drop, bitch

23:20.232 --> 23:23.485
She ask how much cost syrup in my cup
That's a lot, bitch

23:23.568 --> 23:26.905
Ain't no more purple
So I'm drinkin' yellow snot, bitch

23:26.988 --> 23:30.200
Got some choppers
Got a plug, then I got rich

23:30.283 --> 23:33.161
Cashed out on three Lamborghinis
Just to pop shit

23:33.245 --> 23:36.456
I brought the millions to the circle
Nigga, mob shit

23:36.540 --> 23:39.876
I pray to God my son don't get cursed
For some shit I did

23:39.960 --> 23:43.255
I hit 'em in the chest
And tell 'em that the world his

23:43.338 --> 23:46.591
I put it all on the line
'Cause I'm a gambler, nigga

23:46.675 --> 23:50.053
Just bought my brother
A motherfuckin' Phantom, lil' nigga

23:50.137 --> 23:53.140
I kidnapped this bitch
She let her phone stay dead for 3 days

23:53.223 --> 23:56.143
I just poured a eight
Of Wock' Wock' in a pitcher of Kool-Aid

23:56.226 --> 23:59.604
My barber get a hundo
Every time I get a new fade

23:59.688 --> 24:02.065
Blue Aventador
Blue diamonds at the Blue Flame…

24:02.149 --> 24:03.233
Fuck!

24:21.710 --> 24:25.922
I, uh… I have to take this.
I'll be right back.

24:45.358 --> 24:49.571
I could never, ever chase a bitch…

24:49.654 --> 24:53.200
I'm gonna find him,
and then I'm gonna take you down.

24:54.784 --> 24:56.828
Not if I find him first.

25:04.544 --> 25:05.629
Oh, wow.

25:08.256 --> 25:10.926
So everything looks okay?

25:11.009 --> 25:15.722
Well, it's early, but all indicators point
to a healthy full-term pregnancy.

25:18.266 --> 25:21.353
Look. All the tests are coming in
with flying colors.

25:21.436 --> 25:23.480
Here are your screening results.

25:28.818 --> 25:33.114
What's this? It-- It says,
"Decision to terminate prior pregnancy."

25:33.740 --> 25:35.408
What decision?
I thought we had to do it.

25:35.992 --> 25:38.537
Well, there was a placental abruption,

25:38.620 --> 25:42.582
which posed a significant risk
to your life, but it was a choice.

25:42.666 --> 25:46.211
I… I told you this
as you were coming out of the anesthesia,

25:46.294 --> 25:48.588
but perhaps
things are a little foggy for you.

25:48.672 --> 25:52.342
Because you were unconscious,
and your husband wasn't present,

25:52.425 --> 25:55.053
your sister made the decision
to terminate the pregnancy.

25:56.429 --> 25:57.806
My sister?

26:01.935 --> 26:03.436
She didn't tell you?

26:06.022 --> 26:08.066
Forgive me. I have to leave.

26:08.650 --> 26:10.735
Oh, it's okay. Um, we were just finishing.

26:10.819 --> 26:12.529
Thank you.

26:14.489 --> 26:15.657
Coltrane. I--

26:15.740 --> 26:16.783
Ebony.

26:18.535 --> 26:19.953
Just be on that plane tonight.

26:21.079 --> 26:22.455
I will.

26:32.716 --> 26:34.884
We have just received the identity

26:34.968 --> 26:36.970
of one of the injured police officers.

26:37.053 --> 26:40.056
Detective Jamel Brinkley
was shot at the scene

26:40.140 --> 26:42.392
and is currently in critical condition
at Cedars-Sinai…

26:42.475 --> 26:43.935
I… I don't understand.

26:44.019 --> 26:47.606
Detective Brinkley was just at our house
for Thanksgiving with Grandpa.

26:47.689 --> 26:50.066
There's no way Grandpa would have
done that, shoot police.

26:50.150 --> 26:53.361
Noah, honey, maybe you don't know
Amos as well as you think.

26:53.445 --> 26:56.072
I know him better than you.
I've been going over his house for weeks.

26:56.156 --> 26:58.199
-What?
-You don't watch him closely enough.

26:58.283 --> 27:00.744
You wouldn't let me see my own grandpa,
so I have to sneak over.

27:00.827 --> 27:02.579
And I know he wouldn't do
what they're saying.

27:02.662 --> 27:05.498
Okay, Noah, this is nothing new for Amos.

27:05.582 --> 27:08.918
Your other grandfather has been involved
in gangs and crime his whole life, son.

27:09.002 --> 27:11.546
He's… He's changed. He's not like that.

27:11.630 --> 27:13.882
Amos' character
can't be learned in just a few weeks.

27:13.965 --> 27:16.301
You need to look at a man's whole life
to know who he is.

27:16.384 --> 27:19.304
-Daddy.
-It is time he knew the truth about Amos.

27:19.387 --> 27:20.805
Now is not the time.

27:20.889 --> 27:22.724
Candy. Candy.

27:22.807 --> 27:24.184
The boy's ready.

27:25.935 --> 27:28.521
You know Amos
was involved in the life, right?

27:29.689 --> 27:31.650
But he wasn't just another banger.

27:31.733 --> 27:33.526
No, what you have to understand

27:33.610 --> 27:36.154
is that he got that name Nightmare
for a reason.

27:36.780 --> 27:41.201
He was a violent man who brought
his own son Josiah into the gang.

27:41.284 --> 27:45.872
He was even proud of the fact
that he got the nickname Little Nightmare,

27:45.955 --> 27:49.751
proud that Josiah was becoming violent
just like his daddy.

27:50.377 --> 27:54.381
But that life only ends in two ways,
and Amos knew that.

27:56.466 --> 27:57.384
What ways?

27:57.467 --> 27:59.094
Dead or in jail.

27:59.177 --> 28:02.847
Unfortunately for Josiah,
it was the former.

28:03.765 --> 28:07.602
Nightmare took him on a robbery,
and while he was inside the house,

28:07.686 --> 28:10.271
Josiah was shot dead
by a rival gang in the car.

28:10.855 --> 28:14.067
Nightmare came out shooting,
but it was too late.

28:14.150 --> 28:16.861
Ended up fulfilling
the other fate of a banger.

28:18.113 --> 28:19.906
That's what put him in jail.

28:20.740 --> 28:22.534
That's how his son got killed.

28:23.243 --> 28:26.121
That's the kind of man Amos is.

28:26.621 --> 28:29.791
Someone who cared more about gang life
than he did his own family.

28:31.251 --> 28:34.587
Look, sweetie,
that's why your father tries so hard

28:34.671 --> 28:36.756
to be different than his father.

28:36.840 --> 28:38.800
-"He tries." Wha-- Please.
-Mom, not helping.

28:38.883 --> 28:41.010
She's right. He… He's not different.

28:41.094 --> 28:42.554
-He's just like him.
-Noah.

28:42.637 --> 28:46.182
He care more about all his cop shit
than his own family. They're the same.

28:48.184 --> 28:50.311
Am I gonna be like him?

28:50.395 --> 28:53.148
Is every man in this family fucked up
just in a different way?

28:53.231 --> 28:55.442
-Language!
-Noah, listen to me.

28:56.693 --> 28:58.862
Amos is his own man.

28:58.945 --> 29:00.572
Your father is his own man.

29:01.531 --> 29:04.951
We all make choices
about what kind of man we're gonna be.

29:05.535 --> 29:07.746
So it's up to you, Noah.

29:08.496 --> 29:11.458
You get to decide
what kind of man you're gonna be.

29:25.096 --> 29:26.723
Why you at my spot?

29:26.806 --> 29:30.185
-Peace offering.
-Fuck your peace offering. I'm on duty.

29:30.268 --> 29:33.897
You know a sixer is like a fucking
amuse-bouche to your Samoan ass. Come on.

29:33.980 --> 29:35.899
What the fuck you want, Stiles?

29:37.275 --> 29:40.195
You're making me lose my appetite,
and that's hard to do.

29:40.278 --> 29:42.322
-I know I fucked up.
-Fucked up big time.

29:42.405 --> 29:44.824
-You don't owe me anything.
-Damn right.

29:44.908 --> 29:46.910
But you know about that shit
at Century City.

29:46.993 --> 29:49.704
I am this close to catching
one of the shooters and I need your help.

29:50.747 --> 29:52.332
Hey, he's an old OG.

29:52.415 --> 29:54.626
-He'll try to bust out the country.
-How you know that?

29:54.709 --> 29:57.128
That's what I would do
if I was in the kind of shit he's in.

29:57.212 --> 29:58.046
Come on, Ika.

29:58.129 --> 30:01.758
You know players in the trafficking game
who fuck with the bangers. I need names.

30:01.841 --> 30:02.759
You need to go home.

30:02.842 --> 30:06.763
I heard your ass was suspended,
and this here's my celebration dinner.

30:08.306 --> 30:09.265
Ika.

30:10.016 --> 30:12.310
The shooter is my father.

30:12.811 --> 30:14.103
It's Nightmare.

30:18.107 --> 30:19.859
That's fucked up, Stiles.

30:21.736 --> 30:24.072
-That's real fucked up.
-Yeah.

30:54.018 --> 30:55.353
I appreciate you.

30:56.104 --> 30:59.023
If anybody else comes to you,
let's just keep this to yourself.

30:59.107 --> 31:00.108
Hey.

31:01.192 --> 31:03.194
He may be your pop,

31:03.278 --> 31:04.779
but he's a cop killer.

31:05.405 --> 31:06.364
He needs to get got.

31:06.447 --> 31:08.950
Anybody come and ask for names,
they gonna have 'em.

31:09.534 --> 31:11.536
Now get the fuck out of my face.

31:13.037 --> 31:13.872
Hey.

31:15.832 --> 31:17.125
You go.

31:17.208 --> 31:18.376
That stays.

31:22.630 --> 31:25.508
Hey, did something happen to Isaiah?

31:25.592 --> 31:26.801
Nothing yet, I hope.

31:26.885 --> 31:29.846
But I wanna keep it that way,
so I need to know where he is.

31:29.929 --> 31:34.100
I saw him at the house a few hours ago,
but I haven't heard from him since.

31:34.183 --> 31:36.603
Shouldn't you be with him
trying to find the shooters?

31:36.686 --> 31:38.813
Stiles has been suspended, Candace.

31:39.981 --> 31:41.941
What--? What do you mean suspended?

31:42.025 --> 31:44.611
Sounds like he didn't tell you,
which shocks nobody.

31:44.694 --> 31:48.448
Stiles was suspended and sent back to RHD
for questioning, but he never showed.

31:48.531 --> 31:51.200
Now, whatever he's doing out there
is off book and unsanctioned.

31:51.284 --> 31:54.120
It's only going
to make it worse for him and you.

31:56.414 --> 31:59.292
Now, if you hear from him again,
you need to give me a call, okay?

31:59.959 --> 32:01.794
I gotta go. Bye.

32:06.799 --> 32:08.009
Fuck.

32:11.971 --> 32:13.348
Candace doesn't know anything.

32:15.642 --> 32:18.394
I'm scrubbing through local CCTV footage.

32:18.895 --> 32:23.066
Uh, you do that Gen Z millennial shit
and check social media.

32:23.733 --> 32:25.693
Yeah. On it, Captain.

32:34.285 --> 32:35.620
I don't fucking believe it.

32:38.665 --> 32:40.041
You know who that is?

32:40.750 --> 32:42.460
That's Amos Stiles.

32:42.543 --> 32:46.005
No, that's a fucking "Nightmare."

32:46.089 --> 32:47.256
Let's go. You drive.

32:57.600 --> 32:59.268
Can't bring that in here, old timer.

32:59.352 --> 33:01.396
This goes where I go.

33:01.479 --> 33:03.272
Tell Earl Nightmare's at the door.

33:03.356 --> 33:06.067
Hype me up, hype me up

33:06.985 --> 33:08.277
Hype me up

33:08.361 --> 33:09.946
I hype me up…

33:10.029 --> 33:12.657
Just because you're young
don't mean you gotta be dumb.

33:13.366 --> 33:16.452
Make the call. Live another day.

33:18.538 --> 33:20.790
Oh, man.

33:20.873 --> 33:24.002
-Whatever happened to Big Head Bobby?
-He's been dead.

33:24.085 --> 33:25.294
Bitch shot his ass.

33:25.378 --> 33:29.257
Wasn't the bullet that killed him.
Nigga's brain just got too much oxygen.

33:30.717 --> 33:33.678
Those were different times, man.
We was wild in the streets.

33:33.761 --> 33:36.305
Oh, goddamn right!

33:36.389 --> 33:40.143
But you-- you--
you was always a slick motherfucker.

33:41.394 --> 33:44.230
Ain't no surprise you built all this
while I was on the inside.

33:44.313 --> 33:46.357
Lot of blood, sweat, and tears
in this place.

33:46.441 --> 33:48.067
Not your blood, I bet.

33:48.151 --> 33:50.903
Shit, man, you know me.

33:50.987 --> 33:52.864
Sometimes the old ways are the best way.

33:52.947 --> 33:54.991
Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.

33:56.659 --> 33:57.702
So tell me.

33:58.911 --> 34:00.872
What you come around here for
after all this time?

34:01.956 --> 34:03.458
I need to get south.

34:04.083 --> 34:08.337
I heard you got that
real quiet-type import-export service

34:08.421 --> 34:10.256
out of Mexico that I require.

34:10.339 --> 34:11.841
You heard right.

34:12.800 --> 34:16.012
But I ain't no border coyote
working for pesos and shit.

34:16.095 --> 34:19.891
What I offer is top shelf. So you want
that platinum package? I got that.

34:19.974 --> 34:23.478
But it's gonna cost you,
history or no history.

34:23.561 --> 34:25.063
I'm a business nigga now.

34:25.146 --> 34:27.565
Maybach and G-Wagon trucks…

34:27.648 --> 34:29.567
And I'm a motivated nigga.

34:30.443 --> 34:32.445
A lot of cash and very little time.

34:34.572 --> 34:35.782
Say no more.

34:37.492 --> 34:39.327
You've come to the right place.

34:40.119 --> 34:43.790
I slip you down to Guadalajara,
get you a new ID.

34:43.873 --> 34:46.626
Chill you out in a fresh hacienda
for a couple of weeks.

34:46.709 --> 34:49.879
Push you down south to a country
where the dollar can definitely holla

34:49.962 --> 34:53.341
and the long arm of Johnny law
will never reach your old ass.

34:53.424 --> 34:56.552
All you gotta do
is talk to my guy later on tonight.

34:57.053 --> 35:00.264
Till then, enjoy the amenities.

35:01.140 --> 35:04.102
Stomp a lil' pussy ho
With some shell toes

35:04.185 --> 35:06.312
Yeah Glo! Slappin' rap bitches…

35:06.395 --> 35:07.814
Here you go, baby.

35:37.552 --> 35:39.679
What the fuck are you doing here?

35:39.762 --> 35:41.931
No one has proof
you're involved in this shit,

35:42.014 --> 35:45.226
but if they see you here,
that's a big red flag.

35:45.935 --> 35:48.437
We both want the same thing.
Nightmare dead.

35:48.521 --> 35:51.774
But it's us versus the entire LAPD,
so we need to work together on this.

35:51.858 --> 35:52.942
That wasn't the plan.

35:53.025 --> 35:55.695
Stiles changed the plans.
So you find Nightmare,

35:55.778 --> 35:58.197
I kill him,
and you bag a body and a promotion.

36:01.993 --> 36:03.494
Shit!

36:03.578 --> 36:06.038
Let's go out the back. I'll head them off.

36:14.255 --> 36:16.966
We could try Stiles' house.
Maybe look around the back.

36:17.049 --> 36:19.719
Captain, Cruz. I saw the car pull up.

36:19.802 --> 36:21.679
Harper, what are you doing here?

36:21.762 --> 36:24.223
Earlier today, I saw something
that didn't sit right with me.

36:24.307 --> 36:27.059
Stiles had a shot at one of the suspects
and didn't take it.

36:27.143 --> 36:29.353
He left the scene
before I could talk to him.

36:29.437 --> 36:32.607
And he wasn't at his house, so I looked up
the residence of his next of kin.

36:32.690 --> 36:34.775
Looked around back,
but there's nobody here.

36:34.859 --> 36:36.986
It appears one of the shooters
is Stiles' father,

36:37.069 --> 36:39.197
Amos Stiles, aka, Nightmare.

36:39.280 --> 36:41.490
-Could be why he didn't take the shot.
-Shit.

36:42.617 --> 36:44.202
Guess that makes sense with what I saw.

36:44.285 --> 36:46.913
Right now we need to focus
on finding Nightmare, not Stiles.

36:46.996 --> 36:48.247
Then I want in.

36:49.415 --> 36:53.461
Those men killed my partner.
I wanna be there when we take him down.

36:53.544 --> 36:57.340
Fair enough, but you and me are gonna have
a sit-down when we get back.

36:57.423 --> 37:00.593
You should have called it in.
You shouldn't be out here without backup.

37:00.676 --> 37:02.178
Saddle up. You're riding shotgun.

37:02.845 --> 37:05.806
No, I'll ride in the back. He's the boss.

37:07.225 --> 37:10.561
So, if you were an old gangster
on the run, what would you do?

37:13.522 --> 37:16.567
I'd try to get to Mexico
through one of my old contacts.

37:16.651 --> 37:19.362
Call Ika Matangi in Gang Unit.
He knows the players.

37:28.496 --> 37:31.499
Hey, Matangi. Yeah, it's Cruz. I--

37:36.587 --> 37:38.381
How'd you know why I was calling?

37:42.843 --> 37:44.595
Yeah, thanks.

37:46.764 --> 37:48.975
Stiles just got this name off of him.

37:49.058 --> 37:51.018
Just can't stop digging.

37:51.852 --> 37:54.814
Earl Hayes.
He used to run with Amos back in the day.

37:55.815 --> 37:58.150
Mm, I know exactly where to find him.

38:29.265 --> 38:32.268
Tanya, does Lotta still work at that club?

38:33.269 --> 38:35.354
Lotta, where your ass going?

38:35.438 --> 38:37.523
I'm taking my smoke break.

38:43.321 --> 38:45.865
Wait, wait, wait. Over there.

38:45.948 --> 38:50.161
Fast money, fast whips, it's the life
I had to go and get it…

38:52.163 --> 38:55.291
-I gotta pat you down, player.
-Don't touch me. No need.

38:55.374 --> 38:59.670
-I'm a cop.
-Okay, cop, let me see your cop badge.

39:01.422 --> 39:03.007
-I must have left it in the car.
-Ah.

39:03.758 --> 39:05.593
No badge, no gun.

39:10.681 --> 39:13.559
Shh, be quiet, lеt me pop off

39:13.642 --> 39:16.270
Leave thе club sloppy drunk
Come home and get my rocks off

39:16.354 --> 39:19.065
Heard "Bitch from Da Souf"
He tryna see me knock his socks off

39:19.148 --> 39:21.984
Told them bitches, "Meet me at the top"
Think they got lost

39:23.194 --> 39:24.570
I'm on go like Grizz

39:24.653 --> 39:26.947
She thought I would kiss her ass…

39:27.031 --> 39:29.575
You must be a really good cop
to find me here.

39:30.493 --> 39:33.788
I'd be proud if you weren't the last
motherfucker I wanted to see today.

39:34.580 --> 39:35.664
Come on.

39:36.207 --> 39:37.333
Let's have a sit.

39:37.416 --> 39:39.085
But shit is not a joke

39:39.168 --> 39:41.796
Say she got a problem
Imaginary smoke

39:41.879 --> 39:44.507
Bitches said it's up
Then put it on the floor

39:44.590 --> 39:47.635
I done done it all
Feel like Shawty Lo

39:47.718 --> 39:50.554
Laughin' to the bank
But shit is not a joke…

39:51.389 --> 39:55.768
Yeah, I always knew you wasn't shit,
but never pegged you to be a sucker.

39:56.685 --> 39:58.396
Coltrane used you to get to me.

39:58.479 --> 39:59.438
See?

40:00.022 --> 40:01.774
It's always been your fucking problem,

40:01.857 --> 40:04.693
going around
thinking everything's about you.

40:04.777 --> 40:06.612
Oh, you must be forgetting shit
in your old age.

40:07.488 --> 40:10.449
Who's been supporting
your broke convict ass all these years?

40:10.533 --> 40:11.659
That's been me.

40:12.576 --> 40:15.329
I pay your rent, nigga. I pay your bills.

40:15.413 --> 40:21.877
$327,556 dollars. That's how much I spent
trying to keep you off these streets.

40:22.586 --> 40:25.381
Now I see you out there
in broad daylight shooting cops?

40:25.464 --> 40:27.216
Cut me off,
said I was nothing but a criminal,

40:27.299 --> 40:29.343
so I went out and did some criminal shit.

40:30.761 --> 40:34.181
Now I gotta bring you in to answer
for that too, or else I'm fucked.

40:35.391 --> 40:38.227
Suddenly, me being a step ahead,
it looks different.

40:39.103 --> 40:41.647
Looks like I'm part of this shit.
Is that what you want?

40:42.231 --> 40:44.775
Laughin' to the bank
But shit is not a joke…

40:44.859 --> 40:46.318
You hate me that much?

40:49.196 --> 40:51.198
If not, you need to ID Coltrane.

40:51.282 --> 40:55.411
I done done it all, feel like Shawty Lo
Laughin' to the bank…

40:55.494 --> 40:59.415
You snatched Josiah's chain from my neck

40:59.498 --> 41:02.668
because you know
that's the most important shit I own.

41:04.336 --> 41:05.880
See, Josiah knew.

41:07.590 --> 41:12.761
He knew a real man don't snitch on nobody.

41:13.679 --> 41:17.391
A real man protects his family.

41:18.142 --> 41:20.186
That's something you never understood.

41:20.978 --> 41:23.397
Josiah found it out the hard way.

41:26.358 --> 41:28.486
I got these bitches mad again…

41:28.569 --> 41:29.945
Cops is out front,

41:30.029 --> 41:33.157
so I hate to break up
this touching family reunion, Nightmare,

41:33.240 --> 41:35.201
but you, out the back.

41:35.284 --> 41:36.994
I'll make him eat me through the pants

41:37.077 --> 41:40.164
Stay on her mind
She keep stalkin' like a spy…

41:40.247 --> 41:42.333
-Amos.
-Whoa.

41:43.125 --> 41:46.378
I can't have you and your pop
shooting it out in the parking lot, so…

41:46.462 --> 41:48.714
if you could sit tight for a spell.

41:49.590 --> 41:52.801
I'm all on your nigga face
I might twerk a lil' bit

41:52.885 --> 41:55.346
This your nigga
But he fuckin' with the jit

41:55.429 --> 41:57.598
She like, "Drop the lo'"
But I am not tryna hit…

41:57.681 --> 41:59.892
Or you can head on out the front door.

42:00.476 --> 42:02.311
But you're a cop without a badge.

42:02.394 --> 42:04.939
Something tells me
you don't play well with your friends.

42:05.022 --> 42:07.942
Beefin' 'bout some balls
Hell nah, let's just compare bankrolls

42:08.025 --> 42:09.193
Got him on his knees

42:09.276 --> 42:11.278
Ain't talkin' 'bout ring
He ain't propose

42:11.362 --> 42:12.905
A-ha, a-ha

42:12.988 --> 42:14.823
Bitch, I took your ho

42:15.824 --> 42:16.951
You ain't like that

42:17.034 --> 42:19.912
Said he was yours
Tryna see why yeen got him back

42:19.995 --> 42:22.957
Break his pockets, give me money
Make him drop racks

42:23.040 --> 42:26.126
Should've never gave it up so fast
Why you let him smack?

42:27.419 --> 42:29.255
Tonight, we continue our coverage

42:29.338 --> 42:31.131
of the deadly shooting in Century City,

42:31.215 --> 42:34.176
where authorities are piecing together
what led to the chaos…

42:34.260 --> 42:35.761
Candy. Here, sweetie.

42:36.428 --> 42:38.180
Thank you, thank you.

42:38.973 --> 42:42.184
What do you think will happen
if Isaiah were to catch up with Amos?

42:42.268 --> 42:44.520
You don't think
he'd shoot his own son, do you?

42:44.603 --> 42:47.648
God only knows what a Stiles man would do.

42:49.358 --> 42:52.319
I just wish that he would call,
so I just would know he's safe.

42:52.403 --> 42:54.655
Okay. All right.

42:55.322 --> 42:56.365
-Sit.
-Mom.

42:56.448 --> 42:58.450
Please have a seat.

42:59.451 --> 43:00.744
Please.

43:01.829 --> 43:03.581
Do you hear yourself right now?

43:04.331 --> 43:09.628
You are a grown-ass woman acting like
a schoolgirl waiting for some boy to call.

43:09.712 --> 43:11.880
No, no, let me tell you something.

43:11.964 --> 43:16.218
While you are sitting here
thinking and stressing over Isaiah,

43:16.302 --> 43:19.597
