doing God knows what,

43:19.680 --> 43:22.099
but you know
the one thing he is not doing?

43:22.182 --> 43:23.434
'Cause I can tell you.

43:23.517 --> 43:25.603
He is not thinking about you.

43:26.312 --> 43:29.565
Now what you need to be thinking about
is a good divorce attorney.

43:29.648 --> 43:31.734
-Mom.
-Mm.

43:31.817 --> 43:34.361
Whatever happened
to that nice Jacobson boy?

43:34.945 --> 43:36.572
Mom, please don't bring up Malik.

43:36.655 --> 43:39.867
Malik. Yes.

43:40.367 --> 43:42.953
Yeah. I like Malik. You could trust Malik.

43:51.086 --> 43:52.087
Clock's ticking.

43:53.130 --> 43:55.424
When I said wheels up at midnight,
I meant it.

43:57.635 --> 43:58.761
You hear me?

43:59.970 --> 44:01.388
He'll be here.

44:21.200 --> 44:24.662
About time. I've been waiting on you.
I got the whip out. You got that money?

44:24.745 --> 44:26.497
Whoa, whoa. Why the rush, man?

44:26.580 --> 44:28.374
Everybody on the block
already at Sheri's spot.

44:28.457 --> 44:30.793
And you know she got
hoes for days over there, homie.

44:30.876 --> 44:34.088
And I ain't trying to be late. I'm on
