44:34.171 --> 44:36.423
You ain't catching nothing
with that inchworm you got.

44:36.507 --> 44:39.093
Nigga, I'm the one catching a worm.
It's a metaphor, motherfucker.

44:39.176 --> 44:41.178
Fuck your worm, nigga. What car you get?

44:41.261 --> 44:44.098
Golden Tercel. Clean plates.

44:44.181 --> 44:45.766
Here's your key, OG.

44:50.229 --> 44:51.397
Appreciate it, homie.

45:01.281 --> 45:04.743
Five Gs. Not bad for a bit of driving.

45:08.622 --> 45:10.708
Not bad if I'm a dumb motherfucker.

45:11.667 --> 45:15.212
See, nigga, I done watch you hand out
cash all day like you Oprah or some shit.

45:15.295 --> 45:17.589
Made me wonder how much money you got.

45:18.257 --> 45:20.300
I mean, you should be
sharing the wealth, right?

45:20.384 --> 45:24.221
So you can keep this weak-ass half a band.
I don't need that shit.

45:24.847 --> 45:29.101
What I need, nigga, is half of what's
in that there suitcase. I mean…

45:30.352 --> 45:31.395
You feel me?

45:37.067 --> 45:38.652
So that's how it is?

45:38.736 --> 45:40.571
Yeah, nigga, that's how it is.

45:41.488 --> 45:43.824
I mean, shit.
I could have taken the whole thing.

45:43.907 --> 45:45.576
Lucky I'm feeling generous.

45:47.661 --> 45:51.123
See, this is the problem
with you young motherfuckers.

45:51.665 --> 45:53.625
Got no respect for nothing.

45:54.126 --> 45:58.756
Running around with your pants
around your ankles, posting videos.

45:59.465 --> 46:04.845
A bunch of Instaniggas,
hoeing yourself out for likes.

46:05.554 --> 46:08.015
You're too focused on the wrong shit.

46:09.683 --> 46:11.268
See? Like right now,

46:12.144 --> 46:18.859
you think, 'cause my piece is tucked
around my back, and yours is in the front,

46:19.526 --> 46:22.446
that you got the jump
on an old motherfucker.

46:23.781 --> 46:26.450
But see?
You focused on the wrong shit again.

46:50.891 --> 46:54.102
See how many likes you get
with that shit, nigga.

47:02.027 --> 47:04.321
Isaiah, are you okay?

47:05.239 --> 47:09.159
I had him. Candace, I fucking-- I had him.

47:09.660 --> 47:12.621
But he got away.
He's probably halfway to Mexico by now.

47:12.704 --> 47:14.623
So what does that mean?

47:15.332 --> 47:18.544
It means you can take Noah home.
It's safe.

47:18.627 --> 47:21.588
No. No, no, no,
what does that mean for you?

47:24.424 --> 47:26.260
Means I probably need a lawyer.

47:29.096 --> 47:31.390
A lawyer. Jesus, Isaiah.

47:31.473 --> 47:34.351
I don't know. I'll tell you more
when I get to the house.

47:38.480 --> 47:39.898
I did what I had to do.

47:43.986 --> 47:45.112
Okay.

47:45.696 --> 47:47.614
We'll meet you there.

48:00.210 --> 48:02.129
I'm meeting Isaiah at the house now.

48:07.301 --> 48:08.886
Stiles is headed home.

48:08.969 --> 48:10.012
Flip a bitch.

48:26.612 --> 48:27.821
What the fuck?

48:35.078 --> 48:38.123
Hey, yo, B-Roll, you gotta come through
and bring some of that za--

48:38.206 --> 48:39.458
Where is he?

48:40.250 --> 48:43.170
-He's here. He's fucking dead.
-Old man. Nightmare, motherfucker.

48:45.172 --> 48:46.048
I don't know.

48:47.090 --> 48:47.925
Try harder.

48:48.008 --> 48:51.094
Shit, man, I got him a clean ride,
a golden Tercel, and it wasn't out front,

48:51.178 --> 48:53.055
and I figured the nigga left, all right?

48:53.138 --> 48:56.850
Tell me where he went or you about to have
a sleepover with that motherfucker.

48:56.934 --> 48:59.645
-You hear me?
-Don't know. On the dead homies, I swear.

49:07.945 --> 49:09.154
The chain.

49:26.421 --> 49:30.634
What if half the things ever said

49:31.843 --> 49:34.137
Turned out to be a lie

49:39.393 --> 49:41.812
How will you know the truth?

49:51.196 --> 49:56.159
If you were given all the answers

49:56.243 --> 49:58.704
And you stopped to wonder why

50:03.875 --> 50:06.920
But how will you know the truth?

50:11.466 --> 50:14.302
Everybody's got a right to love

50:16.471 --> 50:18.890
Everybody's got a right to lie

50:21.309 --> 50:24.980
But the choice you make
It ain't no piece of cake

50:26.189 --> 50:31.903
It ain't no motherfucking piece of pie

50:40.537 --> 50:43.165
What If time's only reason

50:44.583 --> 50:47.753
Was to give us all somethin' to fear?

50:50.589 --> 50:53.091
You gotta turn yourself in.

50:53.592 --> 50:56.720
My dad's in a lot of trouble,
but you can help him.

50:56.803 --> 50:59.139
All you have to do is wait here.
He'll be home any minute.

50:59.222 --> 51:01.016
I can't do that, little man.

51:01.099 --> 51:05.771
I'm not going back in.
Not for Isaiah, not for you.

51:05.854 --> 51:07.105
Then do it for yourself.

51:07.189 --> 51:09.066
You've done so much bad shit,

51:09.149 --> 51:12.110
you probably think
it's too late to change, but it's not.

51:12.194 --> 51:14.696
As long as you're alive,
you can still make choices.

51:14.780 --> 51:16.740
You can't change anything you've done.

51:16.823 --> 51:21.078
You can't bring Josiah back,
but you can still save your other son.

51:24.873 --> 51:28.752
There's your dad.
He can't find you in here with me.

51:29.252 --> 51:30.796
Wait.

51:30.879 --> 51:32.089
Wait. What are you doing?

51:32.172 --> 51:33.965
Sit tight there.

51:34.049 --> 51:37.302
I'll handle your dad.
Don't come out until we're gone.

51:37.385 --> 51:38.720
Wait, for… for what?

51:38.804 --> 51:40.764
Good speech, son.

51:41.306 --> 51:43.725
I can see what kind of man
you're gonna be.

51:47.646 --> 51:49.022
Wa… Wait, Grandpa.

52:05.997 --> 52:06.957
Motherf--

52:07.040 --> 52:12.420
There's people tryna kill me

52:12.504 --> 52:14.256
Other than me

52:14.339 --> 52:19.803
There's people tryna kill me

52:19.886 --> 52:21.471
Other than me

52:21.555 --> 52:27.185
There's people tryna kill me

52:27.269 --> 52:29.271
Other than me

52:29.771 --> 52:33.400
My heart is like a drum
Rrdd-umpum-pumpum-pum

52:33.483 --> 52:36.945
I can't say what I want
My conscience weighs a ton

52:37.028 --> 52:40.740
There's nowhere I can run
I thought it would be fun

52:40.824 --> 52:44.452
If I grabbed everyone
Inside the room and--

52:44.536 --> 52:48.165
Decided they're all done
And do them somethin' foul

52:48.248 --> 52:51.793
Like burn them to the ground
I don't feel safe and sound

52:51.877 --> 52:55.505
My ego makes me trip
And kicks me while I'm down

52:55.589 --> 52:58.717
When no one is around
I can't throw in the towel

52:58.800 --> 53:02.345
Gunshots played over nurseries
I lost real guys in a robbery

53:02.429 --> 53:04.181
Fast food
Cigarettes in my arteries

53:04.264 --> 53:06.183
Rapper dead
Making bank off the catalogue

53:06.266 --> 53:07.934
Real beef
Turn that into a sing-along

53:08.018 --> 53:11.438
My brother laid out mixin' wrong pills
Irony is that he got 'em from a MD

53:11.521 --> 53:13.690
Somehow you would've thought
That would've stopped me

53:13.773 --> 53:15.275
Pop one, pop two, I'ma pop star

53:15.358 --> 53:18.904
Who's tryna see a real G-O-D?
You can see it in my face, I'ma hard R

53:18.987 --> 53:22.699
You will never get my real P-O-V
My thoughts get dark when it's just me

53:22.782 --> 53:26.286
This world's fucked up, is it just me?
Just me and my withering psyche

53:26.369 --> 53:31.791
There's people tryna kill me

53:31.875 --> 53:33.627
Other than me
